From: SpeedBreaker Project <speedbreaker-project@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:52:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add instructions used by NFS: Most Wanted (Xbox 360)

- Branches on the summary-overflow/unordered CR bit: bso, bns, bsolr, bnslr.
- CR logic: cror, crorc.
- Integer: mulhd, mulhdu; stfsu.
- VMX: vslh, vsrh, vsrah, vrlh, vsrab, vspltish, vmaxsh, vminsh, vavguh,
  vsubshs, vaddsbs, vaddsws, vsububm, vandc, vsel128, vpkswss(128),
  vpkswus, vpkshss, vpkuhus, vctuxs/vcfpuxws128 (new simde_mm_vctuxs helper),
  vcmpgtsh(.), vcmpgtsw(.), vcmpequh(.).
- Record forms for vcmpgtuh./vcmpgtub. now set cr6.
- XenonTests: only pass -march=sandybridge on x86 hosts (arm64 via SIMDe).

Tested with Xenia's instruction tests plus 227 generated cases checked
against an independent Python model.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
